#=======================================================================
# Name                   : ODCA1_charge.scr
# Date                   : 22-11-2020
# Description            : To fetch the ODCA1 accounts for lace fee charge
# MenuOption             : HTM
# Author                 : Silvester M
# Called Script          : NA
# Calling Script         : NA
# Reference Document     : NA
# Modification History
# S.No.  Date          Name                 Description
